      "id": "claim_77c235236a4f499f9da38bd07202a799",
      "statement": "SaiLoR is a single React codebase run inside the Tauri shell; the web/SPA runtime is discontinued. App.tsx's isTauri() gate checks for '__TAURI_INTERNALS__' in window and, when absent, renders a 'use the desktop app' notice that blocks every project-opening UI before any of it can be reached — the gate renders only after all seven top-level hooks (keybindings, dirty guard, close guard, window title, consolidation alignment, autosave, upstream polling) have run.",
