    {
      "id": "claim_5c22bf9f238243fba2f6a129e6eabd29",
      "statement": "DesktopAdapter delegates file operations to the SlrBridge and serves PDFs through the Rust shell's slr-file:// scheme — the path travels as a query parameter because webview URL parsers collapse '..' path segments. saveProject re-parses the logical whole-project text via loadProject, splits it with splitProjectFiles, and sends only the changed/removed annotation files (plus null metaText when project.json is unchanged); a baseline (lastWritten) of how the project last serialized keeps one reviewer's edit from diffing across every other paper's file, and withBaselineDropped drops that baseline before conflict-prone git operations (pull begin/finish/abort, split) so the shell re-reads the repo instead of trusting a stale snapshot.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src-tauri/src/protocol.rs",
